# env.optional — enrichment / fallback only; the skill runs without these.
# Founder-LinkedIn post scraping at scale (else degrade to render_page.mjs or skip):
PHANTOMBUSTER_API_KEY
# Deeper Reddit / YouTube / review / LinkedIn scraping when the renderer is blocked:
APIFY_API_TOKEN
# Durable run history for the report (otherwise workspace files only):
SUPABASE_URL
SUPABASE_KEY
AIRTABLE_API_KEY
# Structured SERP for the per-channel discovery searches (social/press/podcasts/reviews).
# If set -> paid SERP (DataForSEO or Serper); if not -> the agent's own web search (default):
DATAFORSEO_LOGIN
DATAFORSEO_PASSWORD
SERPER_API_KEY
# Bring-your-own-key synthesis instead of platform-default model (usually unset):
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY
OPENAI_API_KEY
